<lb n="17"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Costantz</placeName> tragen und umb 4 fl. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkoufft</unclear>, deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hefft</unclear>-
