<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lig</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿl</unclear>, vnd 1 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vierling</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nuß</unclear>. genomen, an
